              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಷಾದ — viṣāda — \"regret; sorrow\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ತಪ್ಪಿಗೆ ನನಗೆ ತುಂಬಾ ವಿಷಾದ ಇದೆ. ā tappige nanage tumbā viṣāda ide. I deeply regret that mistake."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal and polite: notices say ವಿಷಾದಿಸುತ್ತೇವೆ, we regret."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಷಾದ (viṣāda) is borrowed from Sanskrit viṣāda, \"a drooping state, languor\" and so dejection (Monier-Williams); in Kannada it is the sorrow of regret."
            }
          ]
        },
